{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Molecular.benzene_threading_emergence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Molecular.benzene_threading_emergence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.SpecificGroups.Dihedral","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith"],"declarations":23,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.benzene_threading_emergence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.benzene_threading_emergence","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L150-L179","doc":"**Benzene threading emergence** (claims i–iv) — the resolving\ndeclaration for `lean.ref` `qou:QOU.Molecular.benzene_threading_emergence`.\n\nConjoins:\n* (i) `n_shared_localised < n_shared_threading` — *derived* from the\n  definitional counts as `6 < 12`;\n* (ii) `symmetry_order = 12` — *derived* via `DihedralGroup.card`,\n  `|D₆| = 2·6 = 12`;\n* (iii) `alexander_weight ≠ 0` — *derived* from the definitional\n  Alexander evaluation `[3]_{q²} = q² + 1 + q⁻²` by positivity\n  (`benzene_alexander_weight_pos`);\n* (iv) `0 ≤ Φ₁^{Kekulé} − Φ₁^{T(2,6)}` — *derived* by instantiating\n  the §3b-cond LP-dual selection hypothesis at Kekulé\n  (`benzene_resonance_nonneg`).\n\nEvery conjunct is derived; the conjectural LP-dual selection enters\nonly as the quantified `threading_minimises` hypothesis. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:benzene-threading-emergence","label":"prop:benzene-threading-emergence","md":"quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/benzene-threading-emergence.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.benzene_resonance_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.benzene_resonance_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L134-L148","doc":"**Theorem (conditional on `BenzeneThreadingSelection`)** — the benzene\nresonance stabilisation shadow price is non-negative:\n`0 ≤ Φ₁^{Kekulé} − Φ₁^{T(2,6)}` (the `.md`'s\n`E_res = α(Φ₁^{Kekulé} − Φ₁^{T(2,6)})` has non-negative sign).\n\nDerived (not projected): instantiate the ground-state-selection\n*hypothesis* at the Kekulé configuration and rearrange. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.benzene_alexander_weight_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.benzene_alexander_weight_pos","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L122-L132","doc":"**Alexander weight positivity — derived sorry-free.**  The `.md`'s\nevaluation `Δ_{T(2,6)}(q) = [3]_{q²} = q² + 1 + q⁻²` is strictly\npositive over any ordered field (each summand is non-negative and the middle term\nis `1`; at `q = 0` the inverse vanishes by convention and the value\nis `1`).  Genuine derivation from the definitional input, not a\nprojected field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingSelection.threading_minimises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingSelection.threading_minimises","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L118-L118","doc":"The LP dual selects the threading link: it minimises `Φ₁` over\nall candidate configurations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingSelection.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingSelection.mk","kind":"ctor","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L115-L115","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingSelection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingSelection","kind":"class","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L110-L120","doc":"§3b-cond conjecture class (non-degenerate per AGENTS.md §3b-cond\nitem 5): carries the conjectural LP-dual *hypothesis* — the\nthreading link `T(2,6)` is the `Φ₁`-minimiser over the candidate\nπ-electron configurations (the ground-state selection) — as a\nquantified field, NOT any conclusion of the theorem below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.Phi1_config","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.Phi1_config","kind":"def","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L108-L108","doc":"`Φ₁` of each candidate π-electron configuration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.alexander_weight_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.alexander_weight_def","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L106-L106","doc":"The Alexander evaluation (definitional input, from the `.md`):\n`Δ_{T(2,6)}(q) = (q³ − q⁻³)/(q − q⁻¹) = [3]_{q²} = q² + 1 + q⁻²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.alexander_weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.alexander_weight","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L103-L103","doc":"Alexander polynomial weight of the threading configuration at `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.q","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L101-L101","doc":"The (real) deformation parameter at which the Alexander weight is\nevaluated (the substrate `q₀` in the physical reading). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.symmetry_order_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.symmetry_order_def","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L98-L98","doc":"The symmetry group of the threading configuration is `D₆`, so its\norder is `Fintype.card (DihedralGroup 6)` (definitional input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.symmetry_order","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.symmetry_order","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L95-L95","doc":"Order of the symmetry group acting on the π-electron\nconfiguration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.n_shared_localised_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.n_shared_localised_def","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L92-L92","doc":"The localised crossing count is `6` (`3 localised π pairs × 2`),\ndefinitional input. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.n_shared_localised","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.n_shared_localised","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L89-L89","doc":"Number of shared crossings in the competing localised (Kekulé)\nconfiguration (`3 × 2 = 6`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.n_shared_threading_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.n_shared_threading_def","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L86-L86","doc":"The threading crossing count is `12` (`6 π-electrons × 2 adjacent\nprotons`), definitional input. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.n_shared_threading","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.n_shared_threading","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L83-L83","doc":"Number of shared `σ⁻¹` crossings in the threading-link\nconfiguration `T(2,6)` (`6 × 2 = 12`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L79-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneThreadingEmergenceContext","kind":"class","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L76-L108","doc":"Data of the benzene threading-emergence claim. All fields are\n*inputs* (geometry counts, the substrate parameter, the Alexander\nevaluation, and the `Φ₁`-functional); none is a conclusion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.instDecidableEqBenzeneConfig","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.instDecidableEqBenzeneConfig","kind":"instance","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L74-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneConfig.dewar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneConfig.dewar","kind":"ctor","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L73-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneConfig.kekule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneConfig.kekule","kind":"ctor","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L72-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneConfig.threading","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneConfig.threading","kind":"ctor","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.BenzeneConfig","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.BenzeneConfig","kind":"inductive","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/benzene_threading_emergence.lean#L68-L74","doc":"The candidate π-electron configurations of benzene compared by the\nLP dual (the `.md`'s candidate table). ","signatureChunk":0}]}